# Events & outbox

- `event_type` and Kafka `topic` are the same string from `Cidadaobr::KafkaTopics` (hyphen-only). `RecordPlatformEvent` defaults `topic` to `event_type`. Add constant + `bin/kafka_create_topics` in the same PR ([ADR-0008](../../../docs/adr/0008-platform-scoped-outbox.md)).
- Payload must be JSON-safe; include tenant/care_team fields expected by `Cidadaobr::EventEnvelope`.
- Request/command specs should assert `DomainEvent` + `OutboxMessage` for integration events.

Do not read `domain_events` in user-facing screens.
